ress  the above pain points of self-managed  databases Cloud SQL is a fully managed  relational database service for postgres  MySQL and SQL Server Cloud SQL offers  full compatibility with the underlying  database engine along with a common API  and management interface across these  engines  symbol bank's many services run on cloud  SQL because provisioning a database in  Cloud SQL takes minutes and can be done  with just a few clicks in the console  via the gcloud CLI tool with terraform  or via the web API  also Cloud SQL automatically increases  storage based on your application needs  connecting an app to Cloud SQL instances  is easy from any application because  Cloud SQL integrates with Google compute  engine Google kubernetes engine and  on-premise servers also bigqueries Cloud  SQL Federation enables bigquery to query  data residing in Cloud SQL in real time  without copying or moving data  backups and point-time Recovery are  automatically enabled for cloud SQL  instances to help protect from data loss  we can restore both on-demand or  automated backups to the same instance  where you took the backup another  instance in the same region or even to a  different region you can easily set up  up to 10 replicas of data across zones  for high availability with automatic  failover which is double or more than  that of the two other large Cloud  providers  Cloud SQL also provides industry-leading  maintenance times and granular control  over maintenance Windows allowing  flexibility to best support your  business  for example for MySQL and postgres Cloud  sql's average maintenance downtime is  shorter than that of Amazon RDS and  Azure database according to figures  published in online documentation as of  August 2021  symbol Bank relies on Google Cloud  databases because they're built on a  globally trusted and secure platform  they provide best-in-class security to  protect systems with five layers of data  protection and help you meet stringent  data and security regulations identity  and access management or IAM integration  gives full control and visibility to  manage authentication and protect  against unauthorized access additional  features like VPC service controls audit  logging access transparency customer  manage encryption Keys integration with  security Command Center data residency  controls Etc help improve security  auditability and compliance  Cloud SQL cost recommenders are powered  by Machine learning algorithms and help  detect idle instances right size over  provisioned instances and leverage  committed use discounts cost  recommenders automatically generate  actionable reports that identify areas  where cost savings are possible  Cloud SQL query insights provides  monitoring and Diagnostics that help to  detect and fix query performance  problems traditional monitoring tools  provide a query-centric view of  performance this limitation can create a  disconnect between database and  application code especially with modern  architectures like microservices  Cloud SQL insights provides developers  with database monitoring through the  lens of the application  developers can use tags to associate  queries with specific business functions  such as payments and business Analytics  query insights supports open Telemetry  standards and makes the query metrics  and traces data available through the  Google Cloud's operations Suite API  query insights integrates Cloud  monitoring to create custom dashboards  and alerts on query metrics or tags and  to send notifications using email SMS  slack pagerduty and more  simple bank migrated to Cloud SQL using  database migration service which is  secure serverless and easy to use they  started migrating in just a few clicks  with a single integrated migration  experience the guided experience of  database migration service took them  through the source configuration  information and setup of network  connectivity for easy execution  the serverless experience of database  migration service eliminated operational  burden as there were no migration  servers to provision manage or Monitor  and auto scaling ensured high  performance and uninterrupted data  replication at scale database migration  service is so easy to use that 85  percent of all migrations using it are  underway in less than an hour  as we've shown you today Cloud SQL  automates and streamlines complex  database management tasks to reduce your  toil and to improve the availability  performance scalability security and  governance of your databases  as part of a new strategic initiative  symbol Bank expanded into the investment  business by offering customers a unified  experience for both their Banking and  investment account management  simple bank wanted to modernize from  Legacy proprietary databases to open  source compatible databases in the cloud  this required a database with even  higher performance availability  manageability and real-time analytic  capabilities they decided to standardize  on postgres because of its portability  Rich functionality extensibility  Enterprise features proven track record  and strong community  Elena the head of digital banking at  symbol is responsible for their  expansion into the investment business  increasing trade volumes and high Market  volatility are creating significant  technology challenges in online trading  simple bank has an opportunity to create  new customer facing experiences and  value if it could get real-time insights  via analytic queries at next level scale  and performance for the retail banking  clients in addition simple bank must be  able to process significantly large  numbers of requests per second while  simultaneously supporting thousands of  analytical queries from supporting  systems that must report on Trends and  aggregate key operational indicators  traditionally this hadn't been possible  through their data warehouse solution  because of the delay associated with  data movement and Transformations then  they implemented alloy DB to solve these  and other problems let's demo you today  what happened there  with loadb simple bank was able to  process transactional investment  operations such as stock and mutual  funds buy and sell orders for all of  their customers and at the same time  displayed real-time analytical  dashboards of all recent trading Trends  anomalies and key performance indicators  while this screen shows simple's  customer facing app the real Innovation  happened at the database underneath the  app it was powered by the hybrid  transactional and analytical processing  sometimes referred to as htap feature  and capability of alloy DB  alloy DB is more than two times faster  than Amazon's comparable postgres  compatible service for transactional  workloads loadb delivers up to 100 times  faster analytical queries than standard  postgres  htap inside ledb is created using two  critical features read replica pools and  a columnar engine combined they deliver  Lightning Fast performance this enables  the processing of multiple workloads  with the same durability consistency and  reliability of a traditional operational  database  here you can see how easy it is to add  read replica pools while maintaining the  performance even with the heavy h-tap  workloads  alloy DB is able to handle analytical  workloads on transactional data without  negatively impacting performance of  production systems as well as linearly  scale out read capacity in non-technical  terms that means your business can get a  whole lot of data analytical  capabilities to derive new insights and  business value it can truly unlock huge  future Innovations for your business and  customers  if you're interested in understanding  what really Powers our underlying  technical differentiation here's a quick  explainer powered by ml Driven Auto  population and management the columnar  engine automatically optimizes to the  application's access pattern delivering  blazing fast performance  in addition lodb uses adaptive machine  learning algorithms to automate database  optimizations such as automatic memory  management data storage tiering and  vacuuming  it does that and a whole lot more to  bring machine learning-led Innovations  and optimizations for our customers to  use in their databases  Elena's digital banking customers are  very happy to engage with our new  Services alloy DB with its htap  capabilities combined with Google scale  performance and availability is perfect  for running new hybrid workloads for  Enterprises also pricing for iodb is  transparent and predictable with no  expense or proprietary licensing and no  opaque i o charges  today we touched on the migrate and  modernized pillars of the digital  transformation Journey with Cloud SQL  and alloy DB stay tuned for upcoming  demos on spanner and bigtable and how  they can help your business create  transformative experiences with Planet  scale services  to help you get started we have a  database migration program with tooling  Technical Resources and financial  incentives to reduce the cost and effort  of your migration  thanks for watching

